  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Georg Stratenwerth is a German investment professional and former partner at J.P. Morgan Partners and Advent International. He led private-equity operations in Germany and established Advent’s Mumbai office before returning to London. His later work included overseeing the Greek operations of Pillarstone, an investment platform created to restructure troubled bank loans.",
    "confidence": {
